      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They should rename \"Very Poor\" to \"No Performance Rank\" to separate it more from \"Poor\". Just optimize your avatars to be at least Poor. Nobody needs very poor avatars.\nMeasuring only \"visible\" Meshes (what Pluto is writing about) wouldn't help. because Avatars need to be loaded. That means Huge Textures would still stay in VRAM. It would current FPS Situation even worse because ppl would put even more textures on there Avatars (because there would be no downside of it) that need to be loaded in VRAM.\nI think Pluto should look in a mirror next time when you talking about others logic.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
