  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-11T18:35:05.873Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Excelent, Good, Medium, Poor.\nThey all fine.\nBut now lets look at \"very poor\"\nthis rank ranges from Avatars that just take 5 FPS to Avatars that take up to 30 FPS.\nIt's impossible to filter those extremely FPS consuming avatars with the current system, that's why I recommend adding a new rank called \"Terrible Performance\" which is worse than \"Very Poor\" so we can filter only for those and still enjoy most avatars since majority of avatars are ranked \"very poor\".",
